Package: elklock
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Agundur <info@agundur.de>
Homepage: https://github.com/Agundur-KDE/EL-Klock
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.0), qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtmultimedia, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils, qml6-module-org-kde-notifications
Description: Eternal Lands clock and alerts for KDE Plasma 6
 Shows game time, selected Special Day notifications and recent invasion
 warnings from Mercator. No account or personal token is required.
